## 7. Item 5.6 — E2E com shinytest2 (🟠 RISCO MODERADO)

### Setup

#### [MODIFY] [DESCRIPTION](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Saira/saira/DESCRIPTION)

Adicionar em `Suggests`:
```
    shinytest2 (>= 0.3.0)
```

Registrar pacote no renv:
```r
renv::install("shinytest2")
renv::snapshot()
```

#### Configuração de ambiente (`.Renviron`)

> [!IMPORTANT]
> `shinytest2` depende de `chromote` que precisa de browser Chromium-based. A variável abaixo **não é gerenciada pelo `renv`** — é configuração de ambiente local.

Cada ambiente (dev/CI) deve ter no `.Renviron`:
```
CHROMOTE_CHROME="C:/Program Files (x86)/Microsoft/Edge/Application/msedge.exe"
```

Em CI (GitHub Actions com Ubuntu), usar:
```yaml
env:
  CHROMOTE_CHROME: /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable
```

### Suíte E2E

#### [NEW] [tests/testthat/test-e2e-flows.R](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Saira/saira/tests/testthat/test-e2e-flows.R)

6 fluxos críticos (cada um com `shinytest2::AppDriver`):

| # | Fluxo | Ação principal | Assert principal |
|---|---|---|---|
| 1 | Upload → mapping → preview → download | Upload CSV, mapear 3 campos, navegar Preview, clicar download | Arquivo CSV baixado com colunas DwC |
| 2 | Gate de validate_names | Mapear scientificName → verificar botão habilitado | Botão `Validar nomes` enabled |
| 3 | Gate de validate_coords | Mapear lat/lon/country → validar com perfil Complete | Resultados de diagnóstico renderizados |
| 4 | Wiki | Buscar "eventDate", filtrar classe "Event" | Tabela filtrada com resultados |
| 5 | Help | Buscar "separador", abrir acordeão | Conteúdo visível no acordeão |
| 6 | Troca de idioma | Trocar PT→EN→PT navegando entre abas | Textos corretos em cada idioma |

Cada teste com:
```r
app <- shinytest2::AppDriver$new(app_dir = ".", timeout = 30000)
on.exit(app$stop(), add = TRUE)
```

### Pipeline de release

#### [NEW] [scripts/release_gate.R](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Saira/saira/scripts/release_gate.R)

Script local que executa suíte completa em sequência:

```r
#!/usr/bin/env Rscript
message("=== RELEASE GATE v0.2.0 ===")

message("\n[1/5] Unit + Server tests")
devtools::test()

message("\n[2/5] CSS Guardrails")
testthat::test_file("tests/testthat/test-css-guardrails.R")

message("\n[3/5] i18n Integrity")
testthat::test_file("tests/testthat/test-utils-i18n.R")
testthat::test_file("tests/testthat/test-i18n-a11y-keys.R")

message("\n[4/5] E2E")
testthat::test_file("tests/testthat/test-e2e-flows.R")

message("\n[5/5] R CMD check")
devtools::check(document = FALSE, manual = FALSE)

message("\n=== ALL GATES PASSED ===")
```

#### [NEW] [.github/workflows/test.yml](file:///c:/Users/Admin/OneDrive/Saira/saira/.github/workflows/test.yml)

GitHub Actions workflow (quando pronto para CI hosted):

```yaml
name: R Tests
on: [push, pull_request]
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v4
      - uses: r-lib/actions/setup-r@v2
      - uses: r-lib/actions/setup-r-dependencies@v2
      - name: Run tests
        run: Rscript scripts/release_gate.R
        env:
          CHROMOTE_CHROME: /usr/bin/google-chrome-stable
```

### Critério de aceite

```r
source("scripts/release_gate.R")  # Todos os gates verdes
```

